3. In brief, the objections by respondent No.1 and 2 are that;
In written statement of objections, respondent No.1 admitted its insurance policy in respect of lorry,
bearing No.KA-04-AA-3277 and its validity as on the date of accident, denied the petition averments generally and contended that, the alleged accident was caused due to the deceased only and it is a self accident/skid and fall while riding the motorcycle without valid and effective driving licence and not wearing the helmet
